{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>活到老學到老，網上有人發現最近一個有趣教韓文頻道，十分好看！韓文女老師邊教書邊派福利，貼身衫包不住豐滿上圍！網 …</p><p></p>\n<p>活到老學到老，網上有人發現最近一個有趣教韓文頻道，十分好看！韓文女老師邊教書邊派福利，貼身衫包不住豐滿上圍！網友紛紛表示：「老師教的真好」。</p>\n<h2>韓語老師用心教學 累積超過23萬名訂閱</h2>\n<p>有網友發現是一個名為「Nostaljia Green」來自韓國的YouTuber，她持續與丈夫共同推出《Mr. and Mrs. Green’s Free Korean Class》免費韓文課程，透過生活化情境與白板講解為初學者提供指導。目前頻道已累積超過23萬名訂閱者，她亦沒有因為爆紅而改變創作方向，繼續專注於分享繪畫創作以及一家三口溫馨互動。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794647270497770_7773346536af824e6d3c32.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-892-010-YouTube-2’22”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794647270497770_7773346536af824e6d3c32.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有網友發現是一個名為「Nostaljia Green」來自韓國的YouTuber，推出免費韓文課程。（圖片來源：Nostaljia Green@YouTube）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464727249579374_10758920246af824e8e578d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-892Beginner2-045123-YouTube-4’11”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464727249579374_10758920246af824e8e578d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>網友紛紛表示：「老師教的真好」。（圖片來源：Nostaljia Green@YouTube）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>韓語老師沖繩沙灘大解放 展現震撼上圍</h2>\n<p>華語圈也有不少觀眾將其影片搬運並翻譯至 Bilibili 分享，其中一條於日本沖繩拍攝性感影片引發網民關注。畫面中，Nostaljia Green身穿極度惹火比堅尼在沙灘上執行任務，貼身泳衣完全包不住她無比豐滿上圍。整個誘惑畫面全由她丈夫Mr. Green親手掌鏡拍攝，完美捕捉妻子震撼全場魔鬼身材，強烈視覺衝擊！</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464727526998891_4738019816af824eba7db3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-2\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464727526998891_4738019816af824eba7db3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>畫面中，Nostaljia Green身穿極度惹火比堅尼在沙灘上執行任務，貼身泳衣完全包不住她無比豐滿上圍。（圖片來源：Bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>感情狀況曝光 鏡頭記錄幸福婚姻</h2>\n<p>女老師咁正，可惜名花有主，她本身已婚並育有一女，平時熱愛攝影及手工藝創作，更會將親手繪製畫作公開販售。除了語言教學外，她亦熱衷於發掘韓國冷門景點與百年村落，甚至曾經遠赴台灣南部小鎮拍攝深度旅行紀錄。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚寶藏頻道 極度羨慕佢老公</h2>\n<p>大批網民看完教學影片後反應極度熱烈。許多人直呼這是一個罕見「寶藏頻道」，紛紛留言表示「老師教的真好」、「這種優質教學頻道，我都是開靜音學習，避免聲音干擾~」，甚至有人笑稱「忽然對學韓語產生興趣」。對於由丈夫親自拍攝惹火比堅尼畫面，大量男網民徹底崩潰並留言大讚「好羨慕老公」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794647275978278_3624898526af824ec4af71.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794647275978278_3624898526af824ec4af71.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>貼身泳衣完全包不住她無比豐滿上圍。（圖片來源：Bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464727775198756_2514768716af824ef0771b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464727775198756_2514768716af824ef0771b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>女老師咁正，可惜名花有主，她本身已婚並育有一女。（圖片來源：IG圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464728253541123_16124389736af824f3199e7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464728253541123_16124389736af824f3199e7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>網上有人發現最近一個有趣教韓文頻道，十分好看！（圖片來源：threads圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464728385753060_1967255036af824f46e5d6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464728385753060_1967255036af824f46e5d6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>女老師咁正，可惜名花有主，她本身已婚並育有一女（圖片來源：Nostaljia Green@YouTube）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%b6%b2%e7%b5%a1%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">網絡熱話</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%9f%93%e5%9c%8b%e7%b6%b2%e7%b4%85/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">韓國網紅</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%9f%93%e6%96%87%e6%95%99%e5%ad%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">韓文教學</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3542937\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 14 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T10:43:44.016179+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1446,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T09:08:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T11:37:56.205486+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T10:37:12.708076+00:00","content_hash":"bb88c85fbadb6a7921880d52cbcfa78f673adf578d82af83e7f78dda6a90f3bb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}